{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 33, :comments ["<b>And he shall be shaved.</b> Around the nesek." "<b>But the nesek he shall not shave.</b> He leaves two hairs close to it all around, so that it will be recognizable if it spreads — for if it spreads it will pass beyond the hairs and emerge into the shaved area (Negaim ch. 11; Sifra)."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:06:11.237595140Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}